<title>CHINA: TABLE-HWA KAY THAI YEAR PROFIT UP 166 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-HWA KAY THAI YEAR PROFIT UP 166 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	2.3	 vs 1.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 1.0	 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     3.79 gain vs 49.97 gain</p>
<p>    Net			 33.18     vs 12.47</p>
<p>    Turnover		  810.40    vs 843.07</p>
<p>    Company name	    Hwa Kay Thai Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     September 23-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Hwa Kay Thai distributes and markets Puma brand products and operates restaurants.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on realisation of fixed assets.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is one H.K. cent vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
